Description: the stereo canvas's strings in nine languages
 Enable 3D, Display Settings..., their tooltips and the canvas's three
 messages in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Spanish, Japanese,
 Korean and Chinese (simplified and traditional).  "Enable 3D" and "Display
 Settings..." are the words of the edition's stereo layer, so GIMP says what
 the edition's Qt programs say.  For GIMP's translators to take over upstream.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (queue row 137, the stereo GIMP's milestone 1)
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-26
---
